<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-SALFORD BEAT WARRINGTON IN SUPER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-SALFORD BEAT WARRINGTON IN SUPER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salford beat Warrington 26-14</p>
<p>(halftime 14-0) in a Super League match played on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Salford - Tries: McAvoy 2, Coussons, Sini. Goals: Blakeley</p>
<p>5.</p>
<p>Warrington - Tries: Forster, Sculthorpe, Vagana. Goal:</p>
